+	/*
+	 * Touch SPI experiment (research/j81-touch-spi-experiment-design.md):
+	 * a spidev test child, deliberately NOT the apple,j81-touchscreen
+	 * compatible -- binding apple_z2 would start reset, boot and firmware
+	 * upload on its own. Mode 3 (CPOL=1, CPHA=1) and 124 * 16 kHz =
